    "description": "<p>The Immaculate strikes with the irresistible force of a riptide current, pulling the target off balance and drawing them helplessly into follow-up attacks. On a successful hit supplemented by this Charm, the attack adds the character's Essence to its raw damage. Additionally, the target is drawn into grapple range if not already there—if the attacker wishes to initiate a clinch on her next action against the same target, the target's player does not add extra dice for resisting the grapple roll. This Charm is part of the Water Dragon Style.</p>",
